/-- **`σ⊥`, a finite element of `|B|`.** The principal filter `↑(σΣ*)` of the cone of `σ`; its
minimal neighbourhood is `σΔ = σΣ*` (Scott). These are exactly the finite elements of `|B|`. -/
def sigmaBot (σ : Str) : B.Element := B.principal (memB_cone σ)

